{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1215463-how-woudl-you-build-shrapnel","id":1215463,"title":"How woudl you build Shrapnel?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-05-05T06:28:45-07:00","id":1215463,"title":"How woudl you build Shrapnel?","content":"So I am doing an Aberrant game which is really just kicking off, but I am planning on using a lot of cannon NPC's in the game as well as plenty of my own making. Shrapnel happens to be one of them, so I was wondering how some of you might set up her powers. So far I've got her with Armor, Bodymorph (1 level of Density Increase, 3 levels of Immolate), Quantum Bolt (Burning), Flight, and Claws (Armor Piercing). Any neat tricks or possible powers that may define her which I have left out? For mega stats, I've really only given her Mega Stamina with a few damage soaking enhancements. <br /> <br /> I am intentionally upping her game a little to be a threat to multiple PC's though perhaps not the entire group at once.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1580-andrewm9","name":"andrewm9","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-05T15:47:51-07:00","id":1215612,"title":"","content":"With the exception of Dormancy (which she seems to increasingly hate using), I think you've pretty much covered all the stuff she's known for.<br /> <br /> I totally overused Bodymorph, back in the day (seriously, it seemed like I had 20 different Bodymorph builds!), so I'd be inclined to just give her levels of Armor and Immolate (and one level of Mega-Strength, perhaps) instead of Bodymorph, and describe her new appearance as a figure of burning metal as a result of Taint/Chrysalis instead of Bodymorph.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23754-ian-turner","name":"Ian Turner","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"93"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-05T18:32:46-07:00","id":1215642,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ian Turner</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1215463-how-woudl-you-build-shrapnel?p=1215612#post1215612\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">With the exception of Dormancy (which she seems to increasingly hate using), I think you've pretty much covered all the stuff she's known for.<br /> <br /> I totally overused Bodymorph, back in the day (seriously, it seemed like I had 20 different Bodymorph builds!), so I'd be inclined to just give her levels of Armor and Immolate (and one level of Mega-Strength, perhaps) instead of Bodymorph, and describe her new appearance as a figure of burning metal as a result of Taint/Chrysalis instead of Bodymorph.<br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I debated that very same thing. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I thought I would fish for other people's take on it. I think I may take your advice","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1580-andrewm9","name":"andrewm9","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}